  "description": "Large, twisting trees frame a sunlit woodland path that bends from the lower centre towards a brighter opening above. A clear blue stream runs diagonally down the left side, stepping over mossy rocks in a small cascade. Roots spread across soft green ground, and clusters of pink, blue and violet flowers gather around the trunks. Pale mushrooms sit beneath the tree on the right, while hanging vines soften the canopy overhead. The path and stream make two distinct routes through the painting: one dry and open, the other edged with stones, water and dense undergrowth.",
